        "TileImage": "$($repository ad93e268-3d6e-4aba-bec0-607cb5451ac7).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47, your targets are Athena Savalas, Mateo Perez and Fabian Mann. The board members of the Miltion-Fitzpatrick bank corporation have recently learned of  the cronkite files. The files would seriously harm the bank&apos;s reputation and stock price. \r\rThe files themselves are reckless investments made by director Savalas and Mann who cheat middle class workers, with Perez as head of security trying to cover up the files. He needs to be eliminated as well.\r\rOne more point, do this silently",
